  <HediffDef>
    <defName>Avir_WhiteFlame</defName>
    <label>white flame</label>
    <description>White flame of the Zenith clinging to the body - it takes hold of anything, metal and machines too, and water does not put it out. It sears and flickers, dazzling, marks the one burning (easier to strike in close), and the Light's echoes come out of it wherever it goes. It burns down by itself.</description>
